stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Inventory: session start
    Inventory --> ConfirmGoal: tools listed
    ConfirmGoal --> Decompose: scope bounded
    Decompose --> Execute: sub-tasks numbered

    Execute --> Detect: each step produces output
    Detect --> Classify: defect found
    Classify --> AutoFix: AUTO-FIX
    Classify --> GuardedFix: GUARDED-FIX
    Classify --> StopGate: STOP candidate

    AutoFix --> ReVerify
    GuardedFix --> ReVerify
    ReVerify --> Detect: still broken → loop
    ReVerify --> NextStep: green

    NextStep --> Detect: more sub-tasks
    NextStep --> CleanRoom: list exhausted

    CleanRoom --> Green: all gates pass
    CleanRoom --> Detect: gate fails
    Green --> Summarize
    Summarize --> [*]

    StopGate --> SearchLoop: knowledge blocker?
    SearchLoop --> Detect: solution found
    SearchLoop --> StopLedger: authority blocker
    StopLedger --> Summarize: ledger complete